\description{
Visualize hierarchal data from leaves (and/or outer branches) towards
root with rectangles. The icicle sectors are determined by the entries in
"labels" or "ids" and in "parents".
}
\details{
\code{go_icicle()} creates a validated graph object (a named list).
\code{add_icicle()} creates one and adds it to a figure.


Nested objects are named lists, e.g. \code{marker = list(size = 10, line
= list(width = 2))}. Each nested object's properties are described in a
section of its own near the end of this page (after \emph{Value}), titled
